Subject: [PATCH v2 18/35] crypto: x86/aes - Remove the superseded AES-NI crypto_cipher
Date: Mon, 12 Jan 2026 11:20:16 -0800
Message-ID: <20260112192035.10427-19-ebiggers@kernel.org>
